data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md-8-
data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md:9:- **DECISIONS.md = decisions, in discussion voice.** A paragraph or two per decision: who proposed it, the push-back, where it landed, the trade-off. Not a spec dump, not a work log, not a bullet list of what the code does. Keep it concise.
data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md-10-- **Small components, no giant files.** Split the frontend into focused component files — reusable ones in `src/components/`, page-specific ones in a colocated `_components/` folder. `page.tsx` composes; it doesn't hold many components. Never let one file grow into a pile of components.
data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md:11:- **Approval gates.** Never commit, push, or delete a branch without an explicit user "go". Code on its own branch; docs/non-code can commit on the current branch.
data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md-12-- **Right-sized, no over-engineering.** Smallest change that fully does the task. Don't add shared constants / config / indirection for values that are fixed requirements (e.g. the 2/1 image caps).
data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md:13:- **Never touch `.env`.** Don't read or edit the user's `.env`. Communicate config only via `.env.example` or chat.
data/github/explore/repos/QuagKhai003__assessment/CLAUDE.md-14-- **Docs move with the work.** Update `DECISIONS.md`, `docs/plan.md`, `docs/tasks.md`, `TESTING.md` as part of the change, not as an afterthought. When a real test run changes, refresh the `TESTING.md` count/report.
